  "description": "Ingests an external data source into the Second Brain. Fetches content from Confluence, Google Docs, GitHub repositories, remote URLs, or any local file format supported by docling (DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, PDF, HTML, EPUB, images, Markdown, CSV, and more), converts non-markdown formats to markdown via docling, runs the /graphify extraction pipeline, and delegates entity persistence (including the graphify-output merge) to /bedrock:preserve. Use when: \"bedrock learn\", \"bedrock-learn\", \"learn\", \"ingest source\", \"import document\", \"/bedrock:learn\", or when the user provides a Confluence, Google Docs, or GitHub URL, a remote file URL, or a local file path to incorporate into the vault.",
